      <h3>Cons</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>At £90/month per clinician, it is expensive for small practices. Budget carefully</li>
        <li>Requires a quiet environment for optimal accuracy. Busy wards and shared offices reduce performance</li>
        <li>The learning curve for voice profile training takes 1-2 weeks. Expect initial frustration</li>
        <li>Some users report the ambient intelligence feature occasionally misses nuanced clinical details</li>
        <li>Contract terms are typically annual with limited flexibility for scaling up or down</li>
