      <p>G2 reviewers rate Dragon Medical One 4.5/5, calling it "essential for any clinician who values their evenings." A Trustpilot reviewer from a Cardiff GP practice said the ambient intelligence "feels like having a scribe in the room." The main complaint: the price is prohibitive for locum GPs and small practices.</p>

