        <li><strong>Interaction alerts:</strong> Flag potential drug interactions based on current medication lists. Consult with pharmacists before administering.</li>
        <li><strong>Family portal:</strong> Allow relatives to view medication schedules and adherence reports. Build trust through transparency.</li>
        <li><strong>Audit trails:</strong> Complete historical record of every medication event for CQC inspection and incident investigation.</li>
