      <h2>7. Occupop</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Healthcare recruitment, applicant tracking, and compliance hiring</p>
      <p><strong>Star rating:</strong> 4.3 / 5</p>
      <p><strong>Starting price:</strong> Approx £149/month</p>

      <h3>Overview</h3>
      <p>Occupop is built for the unique challenges of healthcare recruitment: DBS checks, right-to-work verification, qualification validation, and compliance documentation. A recruitment agency in London uses it to process 200 healthcare worker applications per month, automating the screening that previously required two full-time administrators. The AI features rank candidates by fit score, suggest interview questions based on role requirements, and predict which applicants are most likely to accept an offer.</p>

