      <p><strong>Single-site domiciliary care provider:</strong> Start with Log my Care (free) for family communication and basic records. Add Birdie (£35/user) when you are ready for full digital care planning.</p>
      <p><strong>Multi-site care home group:</strong> Birdie for care planning, Sage HR (£4/user) for workforce management, Radar Healthcare (£3,000+/year) for compliance, and Tableau (£12-60/user) for analytics.</p>
