      <p><strong>The complete stack for a growing care provider:</strong> Birdie (£35/user) + Sage HR (£4/user) + Log my Care family portal (£15/user) + Tableau Explorer (£36/user) = approximately £90/user/month for a digital, compliant, transparent care operation.</p>

